  "hypothesis": "Prepare two equal bounded row envelopes once,sharing one relative cursor/stride across distinct or aliased backings. Remove two absolute row offsets and duplicate stride from execution ABI and one per-row cursor update. Inline preparation dispatch; keep exact old different-step kernel. Replace CopySelfRows with the shared parallel kernel rather than add a third pixel loop. Eligible separate-word rows join only when packed strides match;small/wide/scalar/different-stride fallback stays unchanged.",
